Quick Chicken with Broccoli

2 lb     broccoli
3 cup    cooked chicken, cut into cubes
2 can    campbells cream of broccoli soup
1 cup    milk
1 cup    shredded cheddar cheese
2 T      butter
1/4 cup  bread crumbs

cut up broccoli, put into 9 x 13 pan.
arange chicken on top.
mix soup and milk, pour over all.
add layer of cheese.
add layer of mixed bread crumbs &
      butter
bake 15 - 20 min at 450